rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the target artifact becomes illegal before resolution, you do not gain any life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If Divine Offering resolves, but the artifact regenerates or has indestructible, you\'ll still gain the life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Although creature tokens go to the graveyard before ceasing to exist, they never count as creature cards and won\'t increase the bonus granted by Bonehoard, however briefly."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If lethal damage is dealt simultaneously to the equipped creature and another creature, both creatures are put into the graveyard at the same time. The equipped creature won\'t get an additional bonus from the other creature."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If there are no creature cards in any graveyard when Bonehoard\'s living weapon ability resolves, the Germ will be 0/0 and put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'The value of X is calculated continuously as the number of creature cards in graveyards changes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger because a creature was destroyed won\'t be put onto the stack until after Phyrexian Rebirth finishes resolving. This means the Horror creature token can be targeted by those abilities, if applicable."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature regenerates or has indestructible, it won\'t be counted when determining the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the artifact it\'s copying, as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'Each time the ability triggers, you can pay {2} only one time to get one token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the artifact that caused Mirrorworks\'s ability to trigger has already left the battlefield by the time the ability resolves, you can still pay {2}. If you do, you\'ll still put a token onto the battlefield. That token has the copiable values of the characteristics of that nontoken artifact as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The copiable values of the token\'s characteristics are the same as the copiable values of the characteristics of the artifact it\'s copying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If one of the targets is illegal when the activated ability resolves, nothing will happen and the Equipment won\'t move. Notably, if an opponent gains control of either target in response, the Equipment won\'t move."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the equip ability, Brass Squire\'s ability can be activated whenever you could cast an instant."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is also an artifact when Go for the Throat tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If this spell doesn\'t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner\'s library."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because you follow the spell\'s instructions in order, you won\'t be able to draw the same Blue Sun\'s Zenith that you cast."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If this spell doesn\'t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Spine of Ish Sah\'s last ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it. You must find another way to get Spine of Ish Sah into the graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Ichor Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "You may target and put a charge counter on any artifact, even if it doesn\'t have an ability that references charge counters."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'A player is poisoned if that player has one or more poison counters.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Septic Rats gets a maximum of +1/+1 from its ability, no matter how many poison counters the defending player has.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities; they have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an activated ability of a card exiled with Myr Welder references the card it’s printed on by name, treat Myr Welder’s version of that ability as though it referenced Myr Welder by name instead. For example, if Lux Cannon (which says, in part, “{T}: Put a charge counter on Lux Cannon.”) has been exiled by Myr Welder, Myr Welder has the ability “{T}: Put a charge counter on Myr Welder.”'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Myr Welder has only the activated abilities of cards it exiles. It doesn’t gain triggered abilities or static abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Although the tokens are attacking, they never were declared as attacking creatures (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Whenever Hero of Bladehold attacks, both abilities will trigger. You can put them onto the stack in any order. If the token-creating ability resolves first, the tokens each get +1/+0 until end of turn from the battle cry ability.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You choose which opponent or planeswalker an opponent controls that each token is attacking when it is put onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'An artifact spell exists only on the stack. An artifact exists only on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Any other abilities that trigger when you cast the original spell (for example, if you cast Emrakul, the Aeons Torn) will still trigger and go on the stack.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If multiple Knowledge Pools are on the battlefield, keep track of which cards are exiled by each of them. Whenever a player casts a spell from their hand: -- If all Knowledge Pools are controlled by the same player, that player chooses the order in which the triggered abilities are put onto the stack. The last one put onto the stack will be the first to resolve. -- If multiple players each control one or more Knowledge Pools, the active player put their triggered abilities on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last ability put onto the stack this way will be the first to resolve. -- The first triggered ability to resolve will exile the original spell, then the player who cast that spell may cast one of the nonland cards exiled by the Knowledge Pool that generated that triggered ability. The abilities of other Knowledge Pools will do nothing when they resolve, as the original spell will already have been exiled.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the card has any mandatory additional costs, as Kuldotha Rebirth does, you must pay them in order to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the card you cast without paying its mana cost has an X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the original spell isn’t exiled (perhaps because it’s countered by another spell or ability before Knowledge Pool’s second triggered ability resolves), the rest of the ability does nothing. The player doesn’t get to cast an exiled card.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If there are no nonland cards exiled by Knowledge Pool, the original spell is still exiled.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The spell a player casts from their hand won’t resolve if it’s exiled, even if that spell can’t be countered by spells or abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Timing restrictions based on the card’s type are ignored. For example, you can cast an exiled creature card this way. Other restrictions, such as Spinal Embrace’s “Cast Spinal Embrace only during combat” are not ignored.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You may cast any other card exiled by Knowledge Pool, including one owned by an opponent. Any card exiled by Knowledge Pool’s enters-the-battlefield ability or its other triggered ability may be cast.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You may pay additional costs, such as kicker costs, of the exiled card.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Creatures with power 1 or less can’t block even if they weren’t on the battlefield when the last ability resolved.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The power of each creature is checked only when blocking creatures are declared. If a creature has power 1 or less at that time, it can’t block, even if its power was greater than 1 when the last ability resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Damage from a source with infect has no effect on Melira’s Keepers. No -1/-1 counters are placed on it, and no damage is marked on it. The damage is still dealt for purposes of effects that care about damage, such as lifelink.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Melira’s Keepers would enter the battlefield with a counter on it, it simply enters the battlefield without that counter.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If a creature with a counter on it becomes a copy of Melira’s Keepers, those counters will remain.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Melira’s Keepers can’t have any kind of counters placed on it, not just -1/-1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Effects that modify that creature’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as -1/-1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the target of the second ability is already an artifact creature, its power and toughness will each become 5. This overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after this ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The artifact targeted by the second ability will retain any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has. Notably, if an Equipment becomes an artifact creature, it can’t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted when the last ability resolves, not when it is activated.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Even though Rally the Forces affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Rally the Forces is cast before attackers are declared or after combat ends, it won’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Even though the triggered ability affects only attacking creatures, the bonuses will remain for the rest of the turn.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Victory’s Herald also gains flying (which will likely be redundant) and lifelink if it’s still attacking when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Gaining control of Contested War Zone doesn’t cause it to tap or untap.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'In some multiplayer formats, creatures controlled by different players may deal combat damage to you simultaneously. If this happens, you control each triggered ability and can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability to resolve will determine who ends up controlling Contested War Zone.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The last activated ability affects all attacking creatures, not just those you control.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The word “you” in a permanent’s trigger condition always refers to the permanent’s current controller.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Fangren Marauder has itself become an artifact for some reason, you’ll gain 5 life when it is put into a graveyard from the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Inkmoth Nexus entered the battlefield this turn and it’s not a creature, it can be tapped for mana. If it becomes a creature that turn, it can’t attack or be tapped for mana.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If you’ve controlled Inkmoth Nexus continuously since your most recent turn began and it becomes a creature, it can attack or be tapped for mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Leonin Relic-Warder leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and when it resolves, do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the targeted artifact or enchantment with no way to return it to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Phyrexian Crusader blocks or is blocked by a creature without first strike or double strike, the damage dealt by Phyrexian Crusader results in -1/-1 counters that will affect how much damage the other creature assigns (if it’s still on the battlefield).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Rot Wolf and a creature dealt damage by Rot Wolf go to the graveyard at the same time, Rot Wolf’s ability will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Spiraling Duelist has double strike as the combat damage step begins, there will be a second combat damage step. As that second combat damage step begins, if Spiraling Duelist no longer has double strike (perhaps because an artifact creature you controlled was destroyed), Spiraling Duelist will not assign combat damage a second time.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Spire Serpent has been declared as an attacker, and you stop controlling three or more artifacts later in combat, Spire Serpent continues being an attacking creature until combat ends.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Spire Serpent still has defender if you control three or more artifacts, although it will be able to attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If Training Drone has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature, and it stops being equipped later in combat, it won’t stop attacking or blocking.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an artifact you own and a creature an opponent controls go to the graveyard at the same time, you may choose that artifact card as the target of Glissa, the Traitor’s ability (even if they’re the same card: an artifact creature you own that an opponent controlled).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of Cryptoplasm, it will become a copy of whatever Cryptoplasm is currently copying (if anything), plus it will have Cryptoplasm’s triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. Cryptoplasm won’t become a copy of that creature; it remains whatever it was before.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The copy effect lasts indefinitely. Often, it will last until it is overwritten by another copy effect (if it copies another creature on a future turn, perhaps.)'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You choose the target for the triggered ability when the ability is put onto the stack. You choose whether or not Cryptoplasm becomes a copy of that creature when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If damage dealt to Phyrexian Hydra can’t be prevented (due to Leyline of Punishment, for example), it will be dealt as normal and won’t cause Phyrexian Hydra to put -1/-1 counters on itself.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If multiple damage prevention effects, including Phyrexian Hydra’s, are attempting to prevent damage that would be dealt to Phyrexian Hydra, its controller chooses which to apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If multiple sources deal damage to Nested Ghoul simultaneously (because it was blocked by multiple creatures, for example), the ability will trigger for each source dealing damage to Nested Ghoul.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Nested Ghoul’s ability will trigger if a source with infect deals damage to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If no opponent has you put the card into your hand, the card remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'In multiplayer formats, your opponents each make the decision in turn order.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The card is exiled face up. Each opponent will know what the card is when deciding whether to have you put it in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If one or more creatures an opponent controls are put into the graveyard at the same time as Sangromancer, Sangromancer’s first ability will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the card has an X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the card has any mandatory additional costs, as Kuldotha Rebirth does, you must pay them in order to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the card you look at isn’t an instant or sorcery card, it remains on top of your library. You don’t reveal it.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You may pay additional costs, such as kicker costs, of the instant or sorcery card.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Burn the Impure resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen, even if that creature has infect.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Pistus Strike tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. No player gets a poison counter.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature with flying regenerates or has indestructible, its controller will still get a poison counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Spread the Sickness tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t proliferate.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature regenerates or has indestructible when Spread the Sickness resolves, you’ll still proliferate.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. None of its effects happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the creature is not put into a graveyard on the turn Virulent Wound resolves, its controller won’t get a poison counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in their hand or no cards in their library, the other effect still happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the player is an illegal target when Concussive Bolt resolves, the spell won’t resolve. None of its effects will happen, even if you control three or more artifacts.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If you controlled three or more artifacts as Concussive Bolt resolved, the targeted player won’t be able to block with any creatures this turn. That is, the set of affected creatures isn’t locked in as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is checked only once: when Concussive Bolt resolves. If you don’t control three or more artifacts at that time, creatures will be able to block that turn, even if you gain control of more artifacts later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the spell is an illegal target when Fuel for the Cause tries to resolve, it won’t resolve. You won’t proliferate.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You must be able to target another spell in order to cast Fuel for the Cause. You can’t just cast it in order to proliferate, and it can’t target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If the targeted artifact is also a creature when Crush tries to resolve, it won’t resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If there are no artifacts on the battlefield when Viridian Corrupter enters the battlefield, its enters-the-battlefield does nothing. Viridian Corrupter will simply enter the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The enters-the-battlefield ability is not optional. You must target an artifact you control if there are no other artifacts on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If there are no creatures on the battlefield that Piston Sledge could be attached to when its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, it remains on the battlefield unattached.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Piston Sledge to pay its own equip cost. It won’t become attached as it will be in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If this spell doesn’t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If Green Sun’s Zenith is countered, none of its effects will happen. Notably, it will be put into its owner’s graveyard rather than shuffled into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If you own Green Sun’s Zenith, but an opponent casts it (due to Knowledge Pool’s effect, for example), that opponent searches their library for an appropriate creature card, then shuffles that library. That opponent then shuffles Green Sun’s Zenith into your library. You won’t shuffle any library in this case.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'In most cases, if you own Green Sun’s Zenith and cast it, you’ll shuffle your library twice. In practice, shuffling once is sufficient, but effects that care about you shuffling your library (like Psychogenic Probe, for example) will see that you’ve shuffled twice.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If this spell doesn’t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner’s library.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If you sacrifice the equipped creature to deal 1 damage to a target permanent or player, the damage is dealt by the creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Let’s say you activate Gore Vassal’s ability targeting a creature with 3 toughness and 2 damage marked on it. The regeneration shield will be created just before the creature is destroyed for having damage marked on it equal to or greater than its toughness. The creature will then regenerate. That is, all damage will be removed from it and it will become tapped; any counters on the creature, including the -1/-1 counter put on by this ability, remain.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The regeneration shield will last until the turn ends or until it’s used.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can activate Gore Vassal’s ability targeting itself, but it won’t get a -1/-1 counter or regenerate because it’ll be an illegal target when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Magnetic Mine will not trigger when it is put into a graveyard from the battlefield itself, although it will trigger if another artifact is put into the graveyard from the battlefield at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Multiple instances of infect on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'No matter how many of the seven cards have the same name as a permanent, you can put only one of them onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You don’t reveal any of the other cards or the order in which they go to the bottom of your library.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': '“The same name as a permanent” means the same name as a permanent currently on the battlefield as Mitotic Manipulation resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Only creatures your opponents control when Turn the Tide resolves are affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn are not.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Only one card is drawn no matter how much combat damage was dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The equipped creature will remain whatever color(s) it was previously. Becoming an artifact doesn’t make the creature colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of creatures Kemba’s Legion can block is calculated when blocking creatures are declared. Take into account the number of Equipment attached to Kemba’s Legion at that time, as well as any other effects that increase the number of creatures Kemba’s Legion can block.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability looks for any permanent you control with the creature type Thopter, not just the Thopter tokens previously created by a Thopter Assembly.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can activate the ability even if there are no players or permanents with counters on them.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Plaguemaw Beast to pay the cost of its own activated ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can cast this with zero targets. If you do, you’ll get to draw a card. However, if you cast this with at least one target and all of those targets become illegal (because another effect has removed them from the graveyard, perhaps), the spell won’t resolve and you won’t get to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You choose the order of the cards you put on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can tap a Myr that hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay for the cost of the second activated ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice Rusted Slasher to pay for its own regeneration ability. If you do, however, it won’t regenerate. It’ll just end up in its owner’s graveyard as a result of the sacrifice.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You must be able to target two different artifacts in order to cast Into the Core.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If each player controls a Consecrated Sphinx, their abilities will cause each other to trigger until one player chooses not to draw cards.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The ability triggers once for each card an opponent draws. You choose whether to draw two cards as each of those abilities resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You may either draw two cards or not draw at all. You can’t choose to draw only one card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature an opponent controls dies at the same time as Massacre Wurm, Massacre Wurm\'s last ability triggers for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that a creature an opponent controls is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Massacre Wurm\'s last ability goes on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s first ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s triggered ability triggers if a creature an opponent controls dies for any reason, including from its first ability reducing its toughness to 0, as long as Massacre Wurm remains on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If some of the targets become illegal for Kuldotha Flamefiend\'s ability, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn\'t dealt at all. If all of the targets become illegal, you can\'t sacrifice an artifact."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as Kuldotha Flamefiend\'s triggered ability is put onto the stack, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. You can\'t choose more than 4 targets and assign 0 damage to a target."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose whether to sacrifice an artifact or which artifact you\'re sacrificing until the ability resolves. Once you decide to sacrifice an artifact (or not), it\'s too late for players to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'You may choose zero targets. If you do, Kuldotha Flamefiend deals no damage, but you may sacrifice an artifact.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap your lands for mana while the triggered ability is on the stack. However, you\'ll lose any mana you produce this way if you don\'t spend it before the end of the current combat damage step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You\'ll untap all lands you control even if the player can\'t discard a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'A player who has ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Damage from a source with infect is damage in all respects. If the source with infect also has lifelink, damage dealt by that source also causes its controller to gain that much life. Damage from a source with infect can be prevented or redirected. Abilities that trigger on damage being dealt will trigger if a source with infect deals damage, if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Damage that a creature with infect deals doesn\'t result in damage being marked on a creature or a player losing life. Instead, it results in that many -1/-1 counters being put on that creature or that many poison counters being given to that player. Damage dealt to planeswalkers still results in that planeswalker losing that many loyalty counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The -1/-1 counters remain on the creature indefinitely. They\'re not removed if the creature regenerates or the turn ends."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities are written in the form "Cost: Effect." Some keywords are activated abilities (such as equip) and will have colons in their reminder texts. Static and triggered abilities of sources with the chosen name are unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Phyrexian Revoker\'s ability affects sources with the chosen name no matter what zone they are in. For example, a cycling ability of a card with the chosen name can\'t be activated from hand."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, players can\'t attempt to remove Shimmer Myr from the battlefield to make that casting illegal. Removing Shimmer My after you\'ve cast a spell won\'t affect that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Shimmer Myr has no effect on artifact lands because they aren\'t cast as spells."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Tezzeret, Bolas\' Agent", \'text\': \'+1: Schaue dir die obersten 5 Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine Artefaktkarte darunter offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n-1: Ein Artefakt deiner Wahl wird zu einer 5/5 Artefaktkreatur.\\n-4: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert X Lebenspunkte, und du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X das Doppelte der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6189d75c-b036-4f1d-86e4-633685c9205a\', \'multiverseId\': 240622}, \'multiverseid\': 240622}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, agente de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'+1: Mira las primeras cinco cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de artefacto que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\\n-1: El artefacto objetivo es una criatura artefacto 5/5.\\n-4: El jugador objetivo pierde X vidas y tú ganas X vidas, donde X es el doble del número de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27053b6e-4637-411a-8406-c058d15cc9ee\', \'multiverseId\': 240777}, \'multiverseid\': 240777}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, agent de Bolas\', \'text\': "+1 : Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'artefact parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez les autres au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans n\'importe quel ordre.\\n-1 : L\'artefact ciblé devient une créature-artefact 5/5.\\n-4 : Le joueur ciblé perd X points de vie et vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant le double du nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a80544-6244-44f6-a29c-5f0bf6d226e0\', \'multiverseId\': 240467}, \'multiverseid\': 240467}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Agente di Bolas\', \'text\': \'+1: Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta artefatto tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\\n-1: Un artefatto bersaglio diventa una creatura artefatto 5/5.\\n-4: Un giocatore bersaglio perde X punti vita e tu guadagni X punti vita, dove X è pari al doppio del numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daa14f0e-5866-416c-a420-8106009cf60f\', \'multiverseId\': 241707}, \'multiverseid\': 241707}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの工作員、テゼレット\', \'text\': \'+1: あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを見る。 あなたはその中からアーティファクト・カードを１枚公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。 残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\\n-1: アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それは５/５のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\\n-4: プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはＸ点のライフを失い、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはあなたがコントロールするアーティファクトの総数の２倍に等しい。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — テゼレット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbedb87-065c-4b1a-af35-14fdc5556622\', \'multiverseId\': 253987}, \'multiverseid\': 253987}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Agente de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'+1: Olhe os primeiros cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de artefato entre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o resto no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\\n-1: O artefato alvo torna-se uma criatura artefato 5/5.\\n-4: O jogador alvo perde X pontos de vida e você ganha X pontos de vida, sendo X igual ao dobro do número de artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8db59f0-8df2-4a95-ae79-6186b5546735\', \'multiverseId\': 241552}, \'multiverseid\': 241552}, {\'name\': \'Теззерет, Агент Боласа\', \'text\': \'+1: посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать карту артефакта из этих карт и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\\n-1: целевой артефакт становится артефактным существом 5/5.\\n-4: целевой игрок теряет X жизней, а вы получаете X жизней, где X — удвоенное количество артефактов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Теззерет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2752a1c6-d89e-4a1a-88ae-8b6672aa7507\', \'multiverseId\': 241087}, \'multiverseid\': 241087}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯特务泰兹瑞\', \'text\': \'+1：检视你牌库顶的五张牌。 你可以展示其中的一张神器牌，并将其置于你手上。 将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\\n-1：目标神器成为5/5神器生物。\\n-4：目标牌手失去X点生命且你获得X点生命，X为由你操控之神器数量的两倍。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～泰兹瑞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71f2fc8-9831-4b34-9f13-ed6c1ff9c316\', \'multiverseId\': 241397}, \'multiverseid\': 241397}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯特務泰茲瑞\', \'text\': \'+1：檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。 你可以展示其中的一張神器牌，並將其置於你手上。 將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\\n-1：目標神器成為5/5神器生物。\\n-4：目標玩家失去X點生命且你獲得X點生命，X為由你操控之神器數量的兩倍。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～泰茲瑞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b84b7c-c1a8-4378-879e-f3cfbf4f4a53\', \'multiverseId\': 240932}, \'multiverseid\': 240932}]', "[{'name': 'An die Kehle gehen', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Aus Fleisch und Blut zu sein wird auf Mirrodin allmählich zu einer Bürde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240568&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb1faa3b-e105-4957-a978-21fad7696858', 'multiverseId': 240568}, 'multiverseid': 240568}, {'name': 'Golpe a la garganta', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea artefacto.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Tener carne es una responsabilidad cada vez más grande en Mirrodin.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240723&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a74581-ebc3-468f-8355-9b86669a3a15', 'multiverseId': 240723}, 'multiverseid': 240723}, {'name': 'Droit à la gorge', 'text': 'Détruisez la créature non-artefact ciblée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Être fait de chair devient de plus en plus problématique sur Mirrodin.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240413&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63278853-ad4e-495d-b428-ed45e96cd3f1', 'multiverseId': 240413}, 'multiverseid': 240413}, {'name': 'Mirare alla Gola', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura non artefatto bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Essere di carne è sempre più uno svantaggio in Mirrodin.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241653&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f6a7d59-61c2-4330-8ca6-40905eee5f1a', 'multiverseId': 241653}, 'multiverseid': 241653}, {'name': '喉首狙い', 'text': 'アーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '肉体を持つことは、ミラディンでは負担を増すことになる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253933&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7653f59-c642-4d75-97a0-addbbc1d2632', 'multiverseId': 253933}, 'multiverseid': 253933}, {'name': 'Atacar na Jugular', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo que não seja artefato.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Ter carne está se mostrando cada vez mais uma desvantagem em Mirrodin.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241498&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09da06aa-91cc-4dee-a8d4-167d2cdd1937', 'multiverseId': 241498}, 'multiverseid': 241498}, {'name': 'Целиться в Горло', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое неартефактное существо.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Иметь плоть становится в Мирродине все большим недостатком.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241033&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e86f4fba-b624-45d1-961d-25c397252ce5', 'multiverseId': 241033}, 'multiverseid': 241033}, {'name': '直刺咽喉', 'text': '消灭目标非神器的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '在秘罗地，具有肉身这件事逐渐成为负担。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241343&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dda10f8b-8cbb-4813-8320-2bd23c82b1cd', 'multiverseId': 241343}, 'multiverseid': 241343}, {'name': '直刺咽喉', 'text': '消滅目標非神器的生物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '在秘羅地，具有肉身這件事逐漸成為負擔。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240878&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7de16996-4fc8-420c-bfaf-ede0414630c1', 'multiverseId': 240878}, 'multiverseid': 240878}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beherrschung des Metalls\', \'text\': \'Übernimm die Kontrolle über ein Artefakt deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe dieses Artefakt. Es erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Alles wird in den Feuern des Ruhms neu geschmiedet werden." —Urabrask der Versteckte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3645cef-c657-4947-a3a4-f3823182a3e8\', \'multiverseId\': 240596}, \'multiverseid\': 240596}, {\'name\': \'Maestría metálica\', \'text\': \'Gana el control del artefacto objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza ese artefacto. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo será reforjado en los fuegos de la gloria." —Úrabrask el Oculto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ab5973-2427-4872-8226-df752c64567b\', \'multiverseId\': 240751}, \'multiverseid\': 240751}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise métallique\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle de l\'artefact ciblé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cet artefact. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Tout sera reforgé dans les feux de la gloire. » —Urabrask le Secret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca743a4-a3cb-4ba3-ae6f-e4b16dad780f\', \'multiverseId\': 240441}, \'multiverseid\': 240441}, {\'name\': \'Supremazia Metallica\', \'text\': "Prendi il controllo di un artefatto bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quell\'artefatto. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutto sarà riforgiato nelle fiamme della gloria." —Urabrask il Nascosto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b54f19-511e-43df-ad03-197c454b600d\', \'multiverseId\': 241681}, \'multiverseid\': 241681}, {\'name\': \'金属の熟達\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、ターン終了時までそれのコントロールを得る。 そのアーティファクトをアンタップする。 それはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「全ては栄光の炎の中で再び鍛造されるであろう。」 ――隠れしウラブラスク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e0f1a97-49b4-4233-9d0e-d0071cfeb48b\', \'multiverseId\': 253961}, \'multiverseid\': 253961}, {\'name\': \'Maestria Metálica\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle do artefato alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquele artefato. Ele ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Tudo será forjado novamente nas chamas da glória." — Urabrask, O Oculto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f23eb5d-0eec-47bf-b404-8f37746ef2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 241526}, \'multiverseid\': 241526}, {\'name\': \'Овладение Металлом\', \'text\': \'Получите контроль над целевым артефактом до конца хода. Разверните тот артефакт. Он получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Все будет перековано в пламени славы». — Урабраск Скрывающийся\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7130045c-766e-46d6-82a5-37bd0147f11d\', \'multiverseId\': 241061}, \'multiverseid\': 241061}, {\'name\': \'精研金工\', \'text\': \'获得目标神器的操控权直到回合结束。 重置该神器。 它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「荣耀之火将重铸万物。」 ～隐匿者洼巴司\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'482f1013-2ada-431d-9d01-469fa616349a\', \'multiverseId\': 241371}, \'multiverseid\': 241371}, {\'name\': \'精研金工\', \'text\': \'獲得目標神器的操控權直到回合結束。 重置該神器。 它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「榮耀之火將重鑄萬物。」 ～隱匿者窪巴司\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7dd2ae4-0744-4c2c-bcd0-8adce3c89933\', \'multiverseId\': 240906}, \'multiverseid\': 240906}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasenstab-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Blasenstab-Schamane ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Damit eine Baracke produktiv wird, muss man meist nachhelfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a38a94df-0f5b-468d-83a6-cd5e5a9191db\', \'multiverseId\': 240583}, \'multiverseid\': 240583}, {\'name\': \'Chamán bastón ardiente\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Chamán bastón ardiente entre al campo de batalla, hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Un barracón productivo necesita una buena dosis de pinchazos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53fde724-45f5-4d58-9c10-a95d96411a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 240738}, \'multiverseid\': 240738}, {\'name\': "Shamane à l\'aiguillon à cloques", \'text\': "Quand le Shamane à l\'aiguillon à cloques arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Un terrier productif nécessite quelques bons coups d\'aiguillon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73dd15d-da2d-4f5c-b518-8c795d30e59d\', \'multiverseId\': 240428}, \'multiverseid\': 240428}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano della Bacchetta Vescicante\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Sciamano della Bacchetta Vescicante entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Un cunicolo produttivo richiede una buona dose di stimoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb36956f-93c9-4e23-a86b-353e406dccf1\', \'multiverseId\': 241668}, \'multiverseid\': 241668}, {\'name\': \'火膨れ杖のシャーマン\', \'text\': \'火膨れ杖のシャーマンが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火膨れ杖のシャーマンはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'生産的な巣穴にするには、きちんとした催促が必要だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79b954ec-100e-4174-946e-363a29a1bee9\', \'multiverseId\': 253948}, \'multiverseid\': 253948}, {\'name\': \'Xamã da Varinha Vesicante\', \'text\': \'Quando Xamã da Varinha Vesicante entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Para que um vilarejo seja produtivo, é necessário muito estímulo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4949e29f-1819-4e43-be62-86787b842e50\', \'multiverseId\': 241513}, \'multiverseid\': 241513}, {\'name\': \'Шаман Язвенного Посоха\', \'text\': \'Когда Шаман Язвенного Посоха выходит на поле битвы, он наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы гоблины давали результаты, их нужно постоянно подгонять.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa3551a-ab6c-40e4-90eb-bcd9794944ea\', \'multiverseId\': 241048}, \'multiverseid\': 241048}, {\'name\': \'闪刺祭师\', \'text\': \'当闪刺祭师进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'繁旺的繁殖地需要大量的刺激。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cc2cf8c-11c4-4b55-b700-0b980bfa7e59\', \'multiverseId\': 241358}, \'multiverseid\': 241358}, {\'name\': \'閃刺祭師\', \'text\': \'當閃刺祭師進戰場時，它對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'繁旺的繁殖地需要大量的刺激。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fd383b3-f080-4fca-ab9f-b0da417f7bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 240893}, \'multiverseid\': 240893}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutvasall\', \'text\': \'Opfere den Blutvasall: Lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Falls dann die Widerstandskraft dieser Kreatur 1 oder höher ist, regeneriere sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Beraubt sie der treulosen Organe. Gebt den Ungläubigen neue Herzen." —Buch der Maschinen, Vers 1703\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8c4efb8-ec46-4c8d-855d-e03b3f46826a\', \'multiverseId\': 240532}, \'multiverseid\': 240532}, {\'name\': \'Vasallo sangriento\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Vasallo sangriento: Pon un contador -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Luego, si la resistencia de esa criatura es 1 o más, regenérala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro\', \'flavor\': \'"Quítenles esos órganos indignos. Lleven nuevos corazones para los no creyentes." —Tomo de las Máquinas, verso 1703\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea06ada1-316e-4f62-b668-e03ce9b578e5\', \'multiverseId\': 240687}, \'multiverseid\': 240687}, {\'name\': "Vassal d\'entrailles", \'text\': "Sacrifiez le Vassal d\'entrailles : Mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur la créature ciblée. Puis, si l\'endurance de cette créature est supérieure ou égale à 1, régénérez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': \'« Débarrassez-les de leurs organes défaillants. Apportez de nouveaux cœurs pour les infidèles. » —Le Tome des machines, verset 1703\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdb0cb0d-853c-43e2-ae94-195066cb34b3\', \'multiverseId\': 240377}, \'multiverseid\': 240377}, {\'name\': \'Vassallo dei Gheroni\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica il Vassallo dei Gheroni: Metti un segnalino -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio. Poi se la costituzione di quella creatura è pari o superiore a 1, rigenerala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Segugio\', \'flavor\': \'"Liberateli dai loro organi infedeli. Portate nuovi cuori ai miscredenti." —Tomo delle Macchine, verso 1703\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc3328a2-7384-4149-8dc5-f85157866e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 241617}, \'multiverseid\': 241617}, {\'name\': \'流血の臣下\', \'text\': \'流血の臣下を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。 その後、そのクリーチャーのタフネスが１以上である場合、それを再生する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猟犬\', \'flavor\': \'「彼奴らより不信心なる臓器取り除くべし。 信ぜざる者どもに新たなる心臓を。」 ――「機械の書」 1703節\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'174c6140-1126-4e28-81c3-842b18180343\', \'multiverseId\': 253897}, \'multiverseid\': 253897}, {\'name\': \'Vassalo Coagulante\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Vassalo Coagulante: Coloque um marcador -1/-1 na criatura alvo. Depois, se a resistência daquela criatura for maior ou igual a 1, regenere-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sabujo\', \'flavor\': \'"Liberte-os de seus orgãos infiéis. Traga novos corações aos descrentes." —Tomo das Máquinas, verso 1703\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47a16d3d-8fde-4ded-891e-4fb36c0d74a9\', \'multiverseId\': 241462}, \'multiverseid\': 241462}, {\'name\': \'Вассал Пролитой Крови\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Вассала Пролитой Крови: положите один жетон -1/-1 на целевое существо. Затем, если выносливость того существа равна 1 или больше, регенерируйте его.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пес\', \'flavor\': \'«Вырвите их предательские органы. Дайте неверующим новые сердца». —Том Машин, стих 1703\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1af24663-7d0b-4d2a-9b10-f9aa32a9a976\', \'multiverseId\': 240997}, \'multiverseid\': 240997}, {\'name\': \'血块下属\', \'text\': \'牺牲血块下属：在目标生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。 然后如果该生物的防御力为1或更多，则重生之。\', \'type\': \'生物～猎犬\', \'flavor\': \'「拿掉他们不忠的器官。 让拒信者得到全新的心。」 ～《机械圣典》，第1703节\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6c3cc54-4cb6-4f39-af30-92a044844d04\', \'multiverseId\': 241307}, \'multiverseid\': 241307}, {\'name\': \'血塊下屬\', \'text\': \'犧牲血塊下屬：在目標生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。 然後如果該生物的防禦力為1或更多，則重生之。\', \'type\': \'生物～獵犬\', \'flavor\': \'「拿掉他們不忠的器官。 讓拒信者得到全新的心。」 ～《機械聖典》，第1703節\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d72d2022-b09b-408d-b930-cc2d608117f6\', \'multiverseId\': 240842}, \'multiverseid\': 240842}]', '[{\'name\': \'Botschafter des Sieges\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Botschafter des Sieges angreift, haben angreifende Kreaturen bis zum Ende des Zuges Flugfähigkeit und Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Die Korrumpierung stieg bis in den Himmel und erweckte einen strahlenden Champion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cdb2a7c-d303-4840-9689-5181cd1c93d8\', \'multiverseId\': 240543}, \'multiverseid\': 240543}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo de la victoria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Heraldo de la victoria ataque, las criaturas atacantes ganan las habilidades de volar y vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'La corrupción agitó los cielos, despertando a un campeón brillante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db0a2f13-7358-4c98-a348-7357be01f60f\', \'multiverseId\': 240698}, \'multiverseid\': 240698}, {\'name\': \'Héraut de la Victoire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Héraut de la Victoire attaque, les créatures attaquantes acquièrent le vol et le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': \'La corruption fit trembler le firmament, éveillant un champion rutilant.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240388&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9825bc44-a4c6-48f0-8519-d85579e93a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 240388}, \'multiverseid\': 240388}, {\'name\': \'Messaggera di Vittoria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Messaggera di Vittoria attacca, le creature attaccanti hanno volare e legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'La corruzione irritò i santi numi, destando una campionessa scintillante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c0c7de-70a9-43c1-aab3-42bf34d2ab13\', \'multiverseId\': 241628}, \'multiverseid\': 241628}, {\'name\': \'勝利の伝令\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n勝利の伝令が攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャーはターン終了時まで飛行と絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'堕落は天空をも掻き乱し、輝ける勇者を目覚めさせた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24eab946-3086-45ad-aa51-10fedf16e8de\', \'multiverseId\': 253908}, \'multiverseid\': 253908}, {\'name\': \'Arauto da Vitória\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Arauto da Vitória ataca, as criaturas atacantes ganham voar e vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'A corrupção agitou os céus e despertou um campeão resplandescente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a592618e-e427-4e2c-90dd-72a664f08132\', \'multiverseId\': 241473}, \'multiverseid\': 241473}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Победы\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз когда Вестник Победы атакует, атакующие существа получают Полет и Цепь жизни до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Разложение взбудоражило небеса, пробудив сияющего заступника.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2e8b7c-395d-44dc-b31d-bb80e887e6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 241008}, \'multiverseid\': 241008}, {\'name\': \'胜利传令使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当胜利传令使攻击时，进行攻击的生物获得飞行与系命直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'这场腐化惊动上天，唤醒闪耀的斗士。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43b37fd-47ef-421a-921a-4fc9db02d0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 241318}, \'multiverseid\': 241318}, {\'name\': \'勝利傳令使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當勝利傳令使攻擊時，進行攻擊的生物獲得飛行與繫命直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'這場腐化驚動上天，喚醒閃耀的鬥士。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da652b2b-2a63-4087-8568-081af1411f29\', \'multiverseId\': 240853}, \'multiverseid\': 240853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Blatt wenden\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sollen ihre hirnlosen Armeen doch kommen und sich mit der Macht der Genialität messen." —Varil, Neurok-Partisane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ece69dcc-7cab-4bde-846e-7a76855c542b\', \'multiverseId\': 240560}, \'multiverseid\': 240560}, {\'name\': \'Revertir la batalla\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -2/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que sus ejércitos sin mente vengan y se enfrenten al poder de la genialidad." —Varil, partisano néurok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dbe4d88-2fa7-485c-b1d0-1e112f7865e5\', \'multiverseId\': 240715}, \'multiverseid\': 240715}, {\'name\': \'Changer le cours de la guerre\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Que leurs armées décérébrées viennent affronter la puissance du génie. » —Varil, partisan neurok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'511f4123-e293-4658-bf1e-3dd94c1cecc3\', \'multiverseId\': 240405}, \'multiverseid\': 240405}, {\'name\': \'Invertire il Flusso\', \'text\': \'Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lascia che i loro eserciti insensati vengano ad affrontare la potenza del genio." —Varil, fautore Neurok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e0cfb2-aee2-4517-9743-e04f36d03196\', \'multiverseId\': 241645}, \'multiverseid\': 241645}, {\'name\': \'形勢一変\', \'text\': \'あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで－２/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「精神無き軍勢など来るに任せろ。天賦の力を見せてやる。」 ――ニューロックの非正規兵、ヴァリル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d16d363-79ee-4f14-8745-2a74e8a7f338\', \'multiverseId\': 253925}, \'multiverseid\': 253925}, {\'name\': \'Virar a Maré\', \'text\': \'As criaturas controladas por seus oponentes recebem -2/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que seus exércitos descerebrados venham e enfrentem o poder da genialidade." — Varil, guerrilheiro neuroque\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255d63b8-04ea-4936-9407-3a6864b2ba9d\', \'multiverseId\': 241490}, \'multiverseid\': 241490}, {\'name\': \'Поворот Вспять\', \'text\': \'Существа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -2/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть их безмозглые армии придут и столкнутся с мощью гения». — Варил, нейрокский поборник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80bc116a-3925-47ca-9c5c-408dd5d8411a\', \'multiverseId\': 241025}, \'multiverseid\': 241025}, {\'name\': \'扭转局势\', \'text\': \'由对手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「教他们没有心智的部队放马过来，尝尝智者的厉害。」 ～纽若克游击队员帆利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3597f14d-b6c9-4812-a1c1-634af3140efe\', \'multiverseId\': 241335}, \'multiverseid\': 241335}, {\'name\': \'扭轉局勢\', \'text\': \'由對手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「教他們沒有心智的部隊放馬過來，嚐嚐智者的厲害。」 ～紐若克游擊隊員帆利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487fe277-fb7b-4073-9fed-82ac99653d74\', \'multiverseId\': 240870}, \'multiverseid\': 240870}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret der Verbannung\', \'text\': \'Lege ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl oben auf die Bibliothek seines bzw. ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Einer Weihe nicht würdig." —Axsh, niederer Klostermönch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10fcb956-8d50-4fb8-b8e9-40855a3230e0\', \'multiverseId\': 240528}, \'multiverseid\': 240528}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de destierro\', \'text\': \'Pon el artefacto, criatura o encantamiento objetivo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Indigno de ser consagrado." —Axsh, cenobita menor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581be3a9-3ba6-41b0-9632-fb0d489ba3e9\', \'multiverseId\': 240683}, \'multiverseid\': 240683}, {\'name\': \'Décret de bannissement\', \'text\': "Mettez l\'artefact ciblé, la créature ciblée ou l\'enchantement ciblé au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Indigne de consécration. » —Axsh, petit cénobite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240373&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f035ad8-596f-4049-848c-94868d6eef1d\', \'multiverseId\': 240373}, \'multiverseid\': 240373}, {\'name\': \'Decreto di Esilio\', \'text\': \'Metti un artefatto, una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Indegno di consacrazione." —Axsh, cenobita minore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b93783a-3999-42a6-bf86-07ec43b992b5\', \'multiverseId\': 241613}, \'multiverseid\': 241613}, {\'name\': \'消失の命令\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「奉献に値せず。」 ――下位修道士、アクシュ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef593d5-798f-49eb-8597-de9cde8651ab\', \'multiverseId\': 253893}, \'multiverseid\': 253893}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Expulsão\', \'text\': \'Coloque o artefato, a criatura ou o encantamento alvo no topo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Indigno de consagração." — Axsh, cenobita menor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cceca9c-afc0-4926-b7ab-134e4bba3048\', \'multiverseId\': 241458}, \'multiverseid\': 241458}, {\'name\': \'Указ об Изгнании\', \'text\': \'Положите целевой артефакт, существо или чары на верх библиотеки его (их) владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Недостоин посвящения». — Акш, малый инок\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7578c72a-87c0-4551-8a5e-20ab723ea144\', \'multiverseId\': 240993}, \'multiverseid\': 240993}, {\'name\': \'逐令裁决\', \'text\': \'将目标神器，生物，或结界置于其拥有者的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「没资格拿来奉献。」 ～初阶修道士哀格许\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02c7a5e-fa46-40f6-8d7a-0c2e8d8af9a4\', \'multiverseId\': 241303}, \'multiverseid\': 241303}, {\'name\': \'逐令裁決\', \'text\': \'將目標神器，生物，或結界置於其擁有者的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「沒資格拿來奉獻。」 ～初階修道士哀格許\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffb3977-8f82-46c2-90df-722ade302bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 240838}, \'multiverseid\': 240838}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Ansturm leiten\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten 5 Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten darunter offen vorzeigen und diese vorgezeigten Karten auf die Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e63a25-62e1-4eed-bb31-f1970ffc6c72\', \'multiverseId\': 240607}, \'multiverseid\': 240607}, {\'name\': \'Liderar la estampida\', \'text\': \'Mira las primeras cinco cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura que se encuentren entre ellas y poner las cartas mostradas en tu mano. Pon el resto en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b934f517-e418-45e0-a40d-89e6763e3ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 240762}, \'multiverseid\': 240762}, {\'name\': \'En tête de la ruée\', \'text\': "Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature parmi elles et mettre les cartes révélées dans votre main. Mettez les autres au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans n\'importe quel ordre.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5979727-8404-43be-b512-3ab77d118461\', \'multiverseId\': 240452}, \'multiverseid\': 240452}, {\'name\': "Guidare l\'Assalto", \'text\': \'Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura tra esse e aggiungere le carte rivelate alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33439b89-c512-43e4-ae71-26544b373279\', \'multiverseId\': 241692}, \'multiverseid\': 241692}, {\'name\': \'暴走の先導\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを見る。 あなたはその中から望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを公開してもよい。そうしたなら、それらの公開したカードをあなたの手札に加える。 残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6823bacd-fe8f-4dae-8257-f3ca7db00690\', \'multiverseId\': 253972}, \'multiverseid\': 253972}, {\'name\': \'Guiar o Estouro\', \'text\': \'Olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar qualquer número de cards de criatura dentre eles e colocar os cards revelados na sua mão. Coloque o resto no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37e04ae-4821-4fb6-9e27-9e88ca842264\', \'multiverseId\': 241537}, \'multiverseid\': 241537}, {\'name\': \'Во Главе Табуна\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать любое количество находящихся среди них карт существ и положить показанные карты в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf655224-18d5-4179-8964-648aad0311e3\', \'multiverseId\': 241072}, \'multiverseid\': 241072}, {\'name\': \'引领狂奔\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的五张牌。 你可以展示其中任意数量的生物牌，并将所展示的牌置于你手上。 将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62a3b7ba-e5ab-4074-a710-c116eec3562a\', \'multiverseId\': 241382}, \'multiverseid\': 241382}, {\'name\': \'引領狂奔\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。 你可以展示其中任意數量的生物牌，並將所展示的牌置於你手上。 將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f58d896-4ee1-49bb-9d34-82a42f1b4d37\', \'multiverseId\': 240917}, \'multiverseid\': 240917}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Krankheit verbreiten\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und führe danach Wucherung durch. (Du bestimmst eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern, auf denen Marken liegen, und gibst ihnen dann eine weitere Marke einer Sorte, die dort bereits liegt.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Leben ist flüchtig. Phyrexia ist ewig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240581&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70efd9fc-e664-4fed-9a23-446f20599566\', \'multiverseId\': 240581}, \'multiverseid\': 240581}, {\'name\': \'Esparcir la enfermedad\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo, luego prolifera. (Eliges cualquier número de permanentes y/o jugadores con contadores sobre ellos y pones sobre cada uno un contador de un tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La vida es efímera. Pirexia es eterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2746a44-a02a-412e-b035-3a901b37c2bf\', \'multiverseId\': 240736}, \'multiverseid\': 240736}, {\'name\': \'Répandre la maladie\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature ciblée, puis proliférez. (Vous choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs avec des marqueurs sur eux, puis vous leur donnez à chacun un autre marqueur d\'une sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La vie est éphémère. Phyrexia est éternel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240426&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8cba36-882d-4d26-b7cf-ce83e4fd6589\', \'multiverseId\': 240426}, \'multiverseid\': 240426}, {\'name\': \'Diffondere la Malattia\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio, poi proliferare. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori con segnalini su di essi, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di un tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La vita è effimera. Phyrexia è eterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a9045a7-e38f-442f-a6dd-ddc319ad5a42\', \'multiverseId\': 241666}, \'multiverseid\': 241666}, {\'name\': \'病気の拡散\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊し、その後増殖を行う。 （あなたはカウンターの置かれているパーマネントやプレイヤーを望む数だけ選び、その後それぞれに、その上にすでに置かれているカウンターのうち１種類を１個置く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'生命は儚き物。 ファイレクシアは果て無き物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be57295-339e-4323-b4b6-8510e16b795c\', \'multiverseId\': 253946}, \'multiverseid\': 253946}, {\'name\': \'Difundir a Doença\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo e depois prolifere. (Você escolhe um número qualquer de permanentes e/ou jogadores com marcadores sobre eles e depois dá a cada um outro marcador de um tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A vida é efêmera. Phyrexia é eterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1e0b87-6734-42a2-b4b0-7a838140c3da\', \'multiverseId\': 241511}, \'multiverseid\': 241511}, {\'name\': \'Распространение Болезни\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо, затем используйте Распространение. (Вы выбираете любое количество перманентов и (или) игроков, на которых есть жетоны, затем даете каждому из них еще один жетон того типа, который у него уже имеется.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Жизнь быстротечна. Фирексия вечна.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ba67c9-57b6-48ff-9873-58f0b764d173\', \'multiverseId\': 241046}, \'multiverseid\': 241046}, {\'name\': \'扩散病症\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物，然后增殖。 （你选择任意数量其上有指示物的永久物和／或牌手，然后在其上放置一个它已有之类别的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'生命短暂。 非瑞克西亚才是永恒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f5db77a-06b8-47c0-b521-a22a549c43c4\', \'multiverseId\': 241356}, \'multiverseid\': 241356}, {\'name\': \'擴散病症\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物，然後增殖。 （你選擇任意數量其上有指示物的永久物和／或玩家，然後在其上放置一個它已有之類別的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'生命短暫。 非瑞克西亞才是永恆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c86ab6c-2ae7-4419-8e31-c4bcc7f21ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 240891}, \'multiverseid\': 240891}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Truppen sammeln\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Kreaturen erhalten +1/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Werft sie zurück! Möge ihre Unterwelt auch ihr Grab sein!" —Koth vom Hammerclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d383b1-5b02-4095-9792-4aff96c459fb\', \'multiverseId\': 240598}, \'multiverseid\': 240598}, {\'name\': \'Agrupar las fuerzas\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas atacantes obtienen +1/+0 y ganan la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Que retrocedan! ¡Que su mundo subterráneo sea su tumba!" —Koth del Martillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e114b5e3-e1f6-49c3-ad35-8c008a047652\', \'multiverseId\': 240753}, \'multiverseid\': 240753}, {\'name\': \'Ralliement des forces\', \'text\': "Les créatures attaquantes gagnent +1/+0 et acquièrent l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Faites-les reculer ! Que leur monde souterrain devienne leur tombeau ! » —Koth du Marteau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470a6525-b9fa-4cc2-8b4b-e1afd494dcc2\', \'multiverseId\': 240443}, \'multiverseid\': 240443}, {\'name\': \'Radunare le Forze\', \'text\': \'Le creature attaccanti prendono +1/+0 e hanno attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Respingeteli! Che il loro oltretomba diventi il loro sepolcro!" —Koth del Martello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'713f030a-a160-46b1-afd6-c65d8a86ba7a\', \'multiverseId\': 241683}, \'multiverseid\': 241683}, {\'name\': \'軍団の結集\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「押し返せ！ 奴らの世界を墓場にしてやれ！」 ――槌のコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c66207d9-0d54-49ed-bffd-61fe8a15fa4b\', \'multiverseId\': 253963}, \'multiverseid\': 253963}, {\'name\': \'Reunir as Forças\', \'text\': \'As criaturas atacantes recebem +1/+0 e ganham iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos mandá-los de volta! Transformem o submundo deles na sua sepultura!" — Koth do Martelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8161d9c-85eb-41d1-8086-2ff0629fedef\', \'multiverseId\': 241528}, \'multiverseid\': 241528}, {\'name\': \'Подъем Сил\', \'text\': \'Атакующие существа получают +1/+0 и Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Гоните врага! Пусть преисподняя станет им могилой!» — Кос из племени Молота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfadf39f-c544-4e7e-8694-ec2b344305af\', \'multiverseId\': 241063}, \'multiverseid\': 241063}, {\'name\': \'集结部队\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，进行攻击的生物得+1/+0并获得先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「把他们赶回去！ 让他们的地底世界变成他们的坟墓！」 ～锤族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4dc00ca-ad2c-40a4-870d-9db2f855fc87\', \'multiverseId\': 241373}, \'multiverseid\': 241373}, {\'name\': \'集結部隊\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，進行攻擊的生物得+1/+0並獲得先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「把他們趕回去！ 讓他們的地底世界變成他們的墳墓！」 ～錘族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65cf10eb-732a-4fb9-92af-b9344c045311\', \'multiverseId\': 240908}, \'multiverseid\': 240908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Unreinen verbrennen\', \'text\': \'Die Unreinen verbrennen fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls diese Kreatur Infizieren hat, fügt Die Unreinen verbrennen dem Beherrscher dieser Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Flammen knien nicht vor Phyrexia nieder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1794449f-5118-47d2-8e9e-65c44ea9ef3c\', \'multiverseId\': 240584}, \'multiverseid\': 240584}, {\'name\': \'Quemar a los impuros\', \'text\': \'Quemar a los impuros hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Si esa criatura tiene la habilidad de infectar, Quemar a los impuros hace 3 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La llama no se arrodilla frente a Pirexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49c7f0be-03b4-4c65-9d4e-228efc68b578\', \'multiverseId\': 240739}, \'multiverseid\': 240739}, {\'name\': \'Immolez les impurs !\', \'text\': "Immolez les impurs inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée. Si cette créature a l\'infection, Immolez les impurs inflige 3 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La flamme ne se prosterne pas devant Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc21ce34-0207-4779-985b-680e92ae1f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 240429}, \'multiverseid\': 240429}, {\'name\': \'Bruciare gli Impuri\', \'text\': \'Bruciare gli Impuri infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Se quella creatura ha infettare, Bruciare gli Impuri infligge 3 danni al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Le fiamme non si inchinano a Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4df8108e-a173-4ad9-bdf0-3764fb292475\', \'multiverseId\': 241669}, \'multiverseid\': 241669}, {\'name\': \'不純の焼き払い\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。不純の焼き払いはそれに３点のダメージを与える。 そのクリーチャーが感染を持つ場合、不純の焼き払いはそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'炎はファイレクシアに屈しない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86408cf9-d938-4601-a413-7f6a200865e8\', \'multiverseId\': 253949}, \'multiverseid\': 253949}, {\'name\': \'Queimar os Impuros\', \'text\': \'Queimar os Impuros causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Se aquela criatura tem infectar, Queimar os Impuros causa 3 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'As chamas não se rendem à Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6feb19f-da68-42e3-8d6c-942097cc9d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 241514}, \'multiverseid\': 241514}, {\'name\': \'Сожжение Нечистых\', \'text\': \'Сожжение Нечистых наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу. Если у того существа есть Инфекция, Сожжение Нечистых наносит 3 повреждения игроку, контролирующему то существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Пламя не встанет на колени пред Фирексией.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53637811-e9fb-4614-8419-d61039a44e18\', \'multiverseId\': 241049}, \'multiverseid\': 241049}, {\'name\': \'焚毁污物\', \'text\': \'焚毁污物向目标生物造成3点伤害。 如果该生物具有侵染，则焚毁污物对该生物的操控者造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'火焰不向非瑞克西亚屈膝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b807d59-403c-47dd-aff1-237c56d82bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 241359}, \'multiverseid\': 241359}, {\'name\': \'焚毀污物\', \'text\': \'焚毀污物向目標生物造成3點傷害。 如果該生物具有侵染，則焚毀污物對該生物的操控者造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'火焰不向非瑞克西亞屈膝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7befc28c-3b4e-4919-963a-6c34a5142cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 240894}, \'multiverseid\': 240894}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Geißel\', \'text\': \'Infizieren (Diese Kreatur fügt Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken für Kreaturen und von Giftmarken für Spieler zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Vermischen von Öl und Nekrogen hat schon viele gefällige Reaktionen ausgelöst." —Sheoldred die Flüsternde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71689708-02c0-44bf-8e1d-4651995bd298\', \'multiverseId\': 240579}, \'multiverseid\': 240579}, {\'name\': \'Sirviente del azote\', \'text\': \'Infectar. (Esta criatura hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1 y a los jugadores en forma de contadores de veneno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"La unión del aceite y el negrógeno ha producido muchas reacciones satisfactorias." —Sheoldred, la Susurradora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40194208-c120-40ef-9d00-a7e2b3a306ce\', \'multiverseId\': 240734}, \'multiverseid\': 240734}, {\'name\': \'Servant de calamité\', \'text\': \'Infection (Cette créature inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1 et aux joueurs sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« L\'union du pétrole et du nécrogène a produit bien des réactions plaisantes. » —Sheoldred la Susurrante", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7c3c3f-47b5-4c00-9717-c6205f182820\', \'multiverseId\': 240424}, \'multiverseid\': 240424}, {\'name\': \'Servitore Flagello\', \'text\': \'Infettare (Questa creatura infligge danno alle creature sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1 e ai giocatori sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'unione dell\\\'olio e del necrogeno ha prodotto molte reazioni soddisfacenti." —Sheoldred, La Bisbigliante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a0bac5-822f-4765-bb12-218c87c48e89\', \'multiverseId\': 241664}, \'multiverseid\': 241664}, {\'name\': \'災いの召使い\', \'text\': \'感染 （このクリーチャーは、クリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形でダメージを与え、プレイヤーに毒カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「油と屍気の統合は数多くの喜ばしき反応を生み出している。」 ――囁く者、シェオルドレッド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=253944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72fc61a-eba8-458d-9dbe-adf6014da72a\', \'multiverseId\': 253944}, \'multiverseid\': 253944}, {\'name\': \'Servo do Açoite\', \'text\': \'Infectar (Esta criatura causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1 e a jogadores na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"A união do óleo com o necrogênio gerou muitas reações interessantes." — Sheoldred, O Sussurrador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb553d27-6a5b-451f-8b1c-6988bcb3a2c4\', \'multiverseId\': 241509}, \'multiverseid\': 241509}, {\'name\': \'Слуга Нашествия\', \'text\': \'Инфекция (Это существо наносит повреждения существам в виде жетонов -1/-1, а игрокам в виде жетонов яда.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Смесь фирексийского масла и некрогена вызвала немало приятных реакций». — Шеолдред, Шепчущая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634ea0e1-74dd-4df6-b5ce-e3db2bb9aefb\', \'multiverseId\': 241044}, \'multiverseid\': 241044}, {\'name\': \'祸害仆役\', \'text\': \'侵染 （此生物会以-1/-1指示物的方式对生物造成伤害，并以中毒指示物的方式对牌手造成伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「油与化尸瘴的组合，产生许多令人欣慰的反应。」 ～细语者希欧蕊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa617863-e258-4b3b-a407-212de9aefdb1\', \'multiverseId\': 241354}, \'multiverseid\': 241354}, {\'name\': \'禍害僕役\', \'text\': \'侵染 （此生物會以-1/-1指示物的方式對生物造成傷害，並以中毒指示物的方式對玩家造成傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「油與化屍瘴的組合，產生許多令人欣慰的反應。」 ～細語者希歐蕊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed52012a-b31d-4483-9c75-4f735960f872\', \'multiverseId\': 240889}, \'multiverseid\': 240889}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drallmaschine\', \'text\': \'{R}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann die Drallmaschine in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie wird einsatzbereit sein, bevor wir am Oxid-Kamm zuschlagen, und sie wird uns den Sieg sichern." —Ketuc vom Helmclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240660&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9cd5f6d-82df-428a-9680-2837fd14aeb5\', \'multiverseId\': 240660}, \'multiverseid\': 240660}, {\'name\': \'Motor de giro\', \'text\': \'{R}: La criatura objetivo no puede bloquear al Motor de giro este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Estará listo para la batalla antes de nuestro ataque al Risco Oxidado, y garantizará nuestra victoria." —Ketuc del Yelmo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc0510b-232d-4f68-8396-a0adee3c7c42\', \'multiverseId\': 240815}, \'multiverseid\': 240815}, {\'name\': \'Machine à pivots\', \'text\': \'{R} : La créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer la Machine à pivots ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "« Elle sera fin prête avant notre attaque au Contrefort d\'Oxid, et elle garantira notre victoire. » —Ketuc de la tribu du Heaume", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b3a290-848b-4e1e-9249-8a1e39dadb0f\', \'multiverseId\': 240505}, \'multiverseid\': 240505}, {\'name\': \'Macchina Rotatoria\', \'text\': \'{R}: Una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare la Macchina Rotatoria in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarà pronta a combattere prima del nostro assalto a Cresta Oxid e ci garantirà la vittoria." —Ketuc del Timone\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed533b2d-1556-4ef9-9ba1-1171e08e283e\', \'multiverseId\': 241745}, \'multiverseid\': 241745}, {\'name\': \'回転エンジン\', \'text\': \'{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それでは回転エンジンをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「俺らがオキシド峠に攻め込む前にこいつの戦備も整うだろうし、俺らの勝利も確実だな。」 ――兜のケトゥック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=254025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06fb63e2-d6a2-41c9-a5eb-a52555ce4cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 254025}, \'multiverseid\': 254025}, {\'name\': \'Máquina Rodopiante\', \'text\': \'{R}: A criatura alvo não pode bloquear Máquina Rodopiante neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ela estará pronta para a batalha antes de nosso ataque na Cordilheira Óxida e garantirá a nossa vitória." — Ketuc do Elmo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7710a8f0-8d45-42db-ad4f-b3e553b69109\', \'multiverseId\': 241590}, \'multiverseid\': 241590}, {\'name\': \'Машина Вращения\', \'text\': \'{R}: целевое существо не может блокировать Машину Вращения в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Она будет готова к бою перед нашим нападением на Оксидов Кряж и обеспечит нам победу». — Кетук из племени Шлема\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf10cfa-addc-4546-9acb-41048118e02f\', \'multiverseId\': 241125}, \'multiverseid\': 241125}, {\'name\': \'旋转引擎\', \'text\': \'{R}：目标生物本回合中不能阻挡旋转引擎。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「在我们攻打奥悉达山脊之前，它将能派上战场，并保证我方的胜利。」 ～盔族的凯图\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=241435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1b3ff1-af20-4697-bc3a-021d1b5f2e74\', \'multiverseId\': 241435}, \'multiverseid\': 241435}, {\'name\': \'旋轉引擎\', \'text\': \'{R}：目標生物本回合中不能阻擋旋轉引擎。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「在我們攻打奧悉達山脊之前，它將能派上戰場，並保證我方的勝利。」 ～盔族的凱圖\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06b0a324-07ce-49e0-bb56-b733574d6363\', \'multiverseId\': 240970}, \'multiverseid\': 240970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drossreißer\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}: Der Drossreißer erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Solch eine Kreation hat keinen anderen Zweck außer dem, jeden einzelnen von uns auszurotten." —Sadra Alic, Neurok-Strategin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=240631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d797c7b-3941-41e4-8913-c64c7572a9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 240631}, \'multiverseid\': 240631}, {\'name\': \'Desgarrador del Dros\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}: El Desgarrador del Dros obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Perro\', \'flavor\